  "description": "The MOG embodies everything a modern gravel bike should be—purpose‑built, wildly capable, and ready for whatever terrain you point it toward. Its versatility starts with massive tire clearance, accommodating a 700c x 50 mm tire with room to spare for confident handling on everything from fast hardpack to rugged backcountry routes. Add in ENVE’s integrated Cargo Bay, which transforms the downtube’s open space into practical in‑frame storage, and you get a bike that carries your essentials without compromising ride quality or aesthetics.\n\nEvery detail reflects ENVE’s commitment to engineering a gravel platform that’s as efficient on race day as it is adaptable for long‑haul exploration. Whether you’re chasing podiums, chasing horizons, or simply chasing the perfect ride, the MOG delivers a blend of speed, stability, and smart design that sets the benchmark for gravel capability.",
